{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18103630","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18103630","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1810363001:1":{"text":"老身……拜见<style=\"highlight\">苔佩希阁下</style>。","source_cn":"老身……拜见<style=highlight>苔佩希阁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86126333E0DA24D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1810363002:0":{"text":"修缮屋的穆婆婆。你可不是海歌剧场的常客。","source_cn":"修缮屋的穆婆婆。你可不是海歌剧场的常客。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45E306C07010CCCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1810363003:1":{"text":"特地为塞涅而来吗？迟到得太久了吧。","source_cn":"特地为塞涅而来吗？迟到得太久了吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C891A9E8E47DD63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810363004:1":{"text":"老身来此……是为了寻您。","source_cn":"老身来此……是为了寻您。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14080A6F64C24501","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810363005:1":{"text":"原因？","source_cn":"原因？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38AA45EEA52A97E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1810363006:1":{"text":"修缮屋里，有人被赤烛蕊感染……","source_cn":"修缮屋里，有人被赤烛蕊感染……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2045B73734FFA3CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1810363007:1":{"text":"你那位留着金色长发的员工？","source_cn":"你那位留着金色长发的员工？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF4D8B48C9D2B779","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1810363008:1":{"text":"不……不是。是一位病人，是生者。","source_cn":"不……不是。是一位病人，是生者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2ED02133377F70D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1810363009:1":{"text":"瞧瞧你手背上的青筋，既然如此紧张，为何还敢在余面前撒谎？","source_cn":"瞧瞧你手背上的青筋，既然如此紧张，为何还敢在余面前撒谎？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6162E8F3E89CCE65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810363010:1":{"text":"那年轻的生者不过是被你用拙劣的魔法做了一番遮掩，伪装程度还不如码头上一船又一船的耀光人，真以为能蒙蔽余的眼睛？","source_cn":"那年轻的生者不过是被你用拙劣的魔法做了一番遮掩，伪装程...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13894545615E1AEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1810363011:1":{"text":"老身……老身是……","source_cn":"老身……老身是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD684B980BA71074","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","